=2 Walkthrough
* Begin quest by speaking with {n:Chumimi} as {p:Black Mage} in the basement of {z:Heavens Tower}.
** Zoning out of the tower is required after finishing the previous quest.
* After the cutscene, trade a {@i:Silk Cloth|829} {i:Silk Cloth|Silk Cloth|829} to **{p:Koru-Moru}** (E-7) in {z:Windurst Walls}.
* Return to Chumimi afterwards to receive the {@k} {k:"Sluice Surveyor Mk. I"}.

!Toraimarai Canal-map1.jpg|right|Map 1
!Toraimarai Canal-map2.jpg|right|Map 2
* Proceed to {z:Toraimarai Canal} and locate two __???__ points.
** **Manafont is required so make sure you are on Black Mage.**
** You must examine the point when it is in front of you.
*** If you are too far away or on the opposite side of the concrete grate, you will receive a message that you cannot examine further.
* The first __???__ is in the North-east corner of (H-7) on map 1.
** From the Survival Guide follow the left wall until you come to a grate blocking the path. The "__???__" Will be right there.
* The second __???__ is at (I-9) on (map 1).
* At one of the __???__ you'll get a cutscene then be asked for "the Mage's black power".
** Use {@g:Two-Hour ability|Two-Hour ability} {p:Manafont}, then check the __???__ again for another cutscene.
** This is usually the second point you examine, however there is a very low chance that the first point can require it too.
** **You do not need to be on Black Mage for the rest of the quest**
* Go to (J-8) and click on the ??? for a cutscene and to pop {m:Magic Sludge}, a Dark Elemental NM.
** There are 2 __???__ right beside each other here. The correct one is the one that is not glowing.
** The NM is highly resistant to physical damage and magic to a lesser extent.
* If there are multiple BLMs in the same party, the NM credit will only go to whoever initiates the CS to pop it.
** There is a 3 minute waiting period before another NM can be spawned after it is killed.
* Click the ??? again for another cutscene
* Return to {n:Chumimi} for the final cutscene and your reward.

=2 Optional Dialogue
* **The following steps are optional.**
* Speak to {n:Kupipi} in {z:Heavens Tower} to receive an {k:earthen charm|Earthen charm}.
* Travel to {z:Inner Horutoto Ruins} and go through the **Sealed Portal** at the {p:Three Mage Gate}.
** Alternately, if you possess a {k:Rhinostery certificate}, you can enter {z:Toraimarai Canal} to get to this section of Inner Horutoto Ruins.
** The quickest way to finish this cutscene, is to use the {z:Toraimarai Canal} Survival Guide teleport. It places you right outside of the zone to the ruins. This is right by the Gate of Earth.
* Examine the **Gate of Earth** at (I-7) for a cutscene.

